** Executable restoration milestone: authentic TX-2 instruction encodings.
** Exercises configuration, partial transfers, both loop signs, deferred
** indexing, V-register aliases and T memory. Undefined opcode 00 stops
** with OCSAL; it is intentionally not a fictional halt instruction.
